{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"伴随"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"伴随"},0]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>伴随是 "},{"Local":{"url":"2-范畴","text":"$2$-范畴"}},{"Plain":"的两个对象之间一对态射的一种关系, 是 $1$-范畴中态射的互逆关系的推广.</p>\n<p>$2$-范畴 $\\mathcal C$ 中的伴随等同于"},{"Local":{"url":"游走的伴随","text":"游走的伴随"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathsf{Adj}$ 到 $\\mathcal C$ 的函子\n$$\r\n\\mathsf{Adj} \\to \\mathcal C.\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<h3>自由-遗忘伴随</h3>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"自由-遗忘伴随","text":"自由-遗忘伴随"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<h3>偏序集之间的伴随</h3>\n<p>见 "},{"Local":{"url":"Galois对应","text":"Galois 对应"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h3>层与平展空间</h3>\n<p>对拓扑空间 $X$, 预层的"},{"Local":{"url":"平展空间","text":"平展空间"}},{"Plain":"与丛的截面层给出了一对伴随\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Presh}(X) \\rightleftarrows\\mathsf {Top}/X.\r\n$$\n这对伴随限制为满子范畴的等价\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Sh}(X) \\rightleftarrows\\mathsf {Et}(X).\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}